---
description: Protect MODELLIX_API_KEY and prefer live docs over invented slugs.
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never print, echo, or commit `MODELLIX_API_KEY` or profile secrets.
- Prefer session-only credentials; persist only when the user explicitly asks (`modellix-cli auth login` / `init` preferred).
- Discover existing key/env/profile before asking again.
- Do not invent model slugs from doc filenames (decimals matter, e.g. `bytedance/seedance-2.0-mini-t2v`). Verify via `model describe`, Docs MCP, or `llms.txt`.
- Product/API/schema docs: prefer Docs MCP (`https://docs.modellix.ai/mcp`) when connected; else `docs_url` / `llms.txt`.
- CLI flags and command syntax: trust npm `modellix-cli` / `--help` over website CLI pages (docs can lag).
